	<div class="body_inner"><main id="content">
		
		<figure class="wp-block-video alignfull"><video autoplay loop muted src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/DC3-B-Roll-Edit.mp4" playsinline></video></figure><div class="wp-block-buttons alignfull quick_links is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-ee033aa9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-dc-3-gold-background-color has-background has-text-align-left wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/future-students/"><strong style="font-size: 1.5em">Future Students</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-dc-3-gold-background-color has-background wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/current-students/"><strong style="font-size: 1.5em">Current Students</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-dc-3-gold-background-color has-background wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/faculty-staff/"><strong style="font-size: 1.5em">Faculty &amp; Staff</strong></a></div></div><div class="wp-block-buttons alignfull quick_links is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-ee033aa9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-dc-3-purple-background-color has-background has-text-align-left wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/parents/"><strong style="font-size: 1.5em">Parents</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-dc-3-purple-background-color has-background wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/visitors-community/"><strong style="font-size: 1.5em">Visitors &amp; Community</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-dc-3-purple-background-color has-background wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/alumni-giving/"><strong style="font-size: 1.5em">Alumni &amp; Giving</strong></a></div></div><div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-dc-3-white-background-color has-background"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-media-text alignfull is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill-element"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="916" height="429" src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Boys-e1698269336403.png" alt="" class="wp-image-14200 size-full" style="object-position:50% 50%" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Boys-e1698269336403.png 916w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Boys-e1698269336403-300x141.png 300w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Boys-e1698269336403-768x360.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 916px) 100vw, 916px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-small-font-size"></h2><p class="has-x-large-font-size">Why Dodge City?</p><p class="has-medium-font-size">At DC3<strong>,</strong> you can take classes that meet your schedule and learning style. With in-person or online class delivery options, you can find the program that is right for you.</p></div></div><div class="wp-block-buttons alignfull is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/why-go-to-dodge/"><strong>Why go to Dodge?</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/future-students/degrees-certificates/"><strong>Degrees &amp; Certificates</strong>  </a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://conqs.dc3.edu/ICS/Course_Search.jnz?portlet=Course_Search&amp;screen=Advanced+Course+Search&amp;screenType=next"><strong>Course Search</strong></a></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-dc-3-purple-background-color has-background"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-media-text alignfull has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill-element"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-small-font-size"></h2><p class="has-x-large-font-size">How to Become a Student</p><p class="has-medium-font-size">If you’re new to DC3, we have answers to your questions. Explore our campus, financial aid options, and academic programs to see how we’re the right fit for you.</p></div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="1000" height="667" src="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/elec_IMG_6055.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-14224 size-full" style="object-position:50% 50%" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/elec_IMG_6055.jpg 1000w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/elec_IMG_6055-300x200.jpg 300w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/elec_IMG_6055-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" /></figure></div><div class="wp-block-buttons alignfull is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://conqs.dc3.edu/ICS/Admissions/"><strong>Apply Now</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/future-students/admissions/"><strong>Admissions Overview</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/future-students/visit-campus/"><strong>Visit Campus</strong></a></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-dc-3-gold-background-color has-background"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-media-text alignfull is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill-element"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_9582-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-15287 size-full" style="object-position:50% 50%" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_9582-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_9582-300x200.jpg 300w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_9582-768x512.jpg 768w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_9582-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_9582-2048x1365.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-small-font-size"></h2><p class="has-x-large-font-size">Life on Campus</p><p class="has-medium-font-size">At DC3, we want you to have the chance to grow. Learn more about the extracurricular activities and events that help you connect and make DC3 feel like home. Enjoy the ride.</p></div></div><div class="wp-block-buttons alignfull is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/current-students/life-in-dodge-city/"><strong>Life in Dodge City</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://dc3.edu/visitors-community/events/"><strong>Events</strong></a></div><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://goconqs.com/"><strong>Athletics</strong></a></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group is-style-quote_carousel is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8cf370e7 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex count-5" data-index="0"><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/IMG_2239-scaled-e1755205350377.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-16815" style="width:200px"></figure><p class="has-m-font-size"><strong>As a Major in the U.S. Air Force and a former F-16 instructor pilot</strong>, <strong>I know excellence when I see it.</strong> The Dodge City Community College staff here in Arizona, both administrative and instructional, consistently demonstrate a commitment to excellence that matches the very best I’ve seen in the Air Force. Their eagerness to help students succeed, whether in the classroom or in the helicopter flight program, is unmatched by any other civilian program I know. The friendly, welcoming demeanor of the administrative team, combined with the knowledge and individualized effort of the instructors, provides every student a clear path to becoming a college-educated, professional helicopter pilot.</p><cite><strong>Terry Blakemore<br></strong>2023 Flight Instructor Program Student</cite></blockquote><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="300" src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/erin_reese.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-1404" style="width:200px" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/erin_reese.jpg 300w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/erin_reese-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></figure><p class="has-m-font-size"><strong>Attending Dodge City Community College helped me take classes with a small student to professor ratio.</strong> After graduation, it helped with a smooth transition to a larger university. It made sense economically and provided a stellar education at the same time.”</p><cite><strong>Erin (Schneweis)</strong> <strong>Reece<br></strong>A.A., B.S., M.A.H.R.</cite></blockquote><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="300" src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/kierra.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-3124" style="width:200px" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/kierra.jpg 300w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/kierra-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></figure><p class="has-m-font-size"><strong>As a single mother, I appreciated the opportunity to further my education in an affordable and supportive environment.</strong> I’m now working toward becoming an elementary school teacher in our local school district. <strong>DC3’s flexible course schedule</strong> is exactly what I needed to be able to go to school and work at the same time. I’m now on my way to becoming the first one in my family to graduate with a bachelor’s degree!”</p><cite><strong>Kierra Johnson</strong><br>Class of 2016, Associate of Applied Science, Early Childhood Education</cite></blockquote><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="300" src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/larry_rod.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-1403" style="width:200px" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/larry_rod.jpg 300w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/larry_rod-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></figure><p class="has-m-font-size"><strong>I wouldn’t have gotten to where I am today without the amazing faculty and learning environment at DC3.</strong> With the ongoing support of the instructors and staff, I was able to achieve more in the field of biochemistry than I ever thought was possible. I owe so much to the staff of DC3 for helping me transfer to Kansas State to complete my biochemistry degree with the help of the <strong>Bridges to the Future</strong> program. I am now working to get both a PhD in pharmaceutical science and a master’s degree in management of drug development. And I owe it all to DC3!”</p><cite><strong>Larry Rodriguez</strong><br>Class of 2012, Associate of Science</cite></blockquote><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="327" height="314" src="https://lk1.52a.myftpupload.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/TrentonSpecht-e1550773910377.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5039" style="width:200px;height:auto" srcset="https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/TrentonSpecht-e1550773910377.jpg 327w, https://dc3.edu/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/TrentonSpecht-e1550773910377-300x288.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 327px) 100vw, 327px" /></figure><p class="has-m-font-size"><strong>Dodge City Community College helped me to become who I am today. </strong>I chose DC3 because I was awarded a scholarship for golf. My coach instilled a toughness in me that I have today, pushing me to become a better person and man in all that I did. I am now giving back by being a high school math teacher and golf coach at Garden City High School.”</p><cite><strong>Trenton Specht</strong> <br>Class of 2011, Associate Degree of Science, GCHS Math Teacher</cite></blockquote><div class="carousel_nav"><div class="dots"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div><div class="arrows"><div class="carousel_arrow back"></div><div class="carousel_arrow forward"></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group alignwide form_outer has-dc-3-purple-background-color has-background"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-ad2f72ca wp-block-group-is-layout-flex"><p class="has-x-large-font-size"><em>Learn More!</em></p><p class="has-medium-font-size">Let us know what email would be best to give you some more information!</p></div><div class="wpforms-container wpforms-container-full" id="wpforms-13326"><form id="wpforms-form-13326" class="wpforms-validate wpforms-form wpforms-ajax-form" data-formid="13326" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/" data-token="340c262bedf20f3491f7fd294d177b1a" data-token-time="1795018188"><noscript class="wpforms-error-noscript">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.</noscript><div class="wpforms-field-container"><div id="wpforms-13326-field_20-container" class="wpforms-field wpforms-field-name" data-field-type="name" data-field-id="20"><label class="wpforms-field-label" for="wpforms-13326-field_20">Your Name <span class="wpforms-required-label">*</span></label><div class="wpforms-field-row wpforms-field-large"><div class="wpforms-field-row-block wpforms-first wpforms-one-half"><input type="text" id="wpforms-13326-field_20" class="wpforms-field-name-first wpforms-field-required" name="wpforms[fields][20][first]" placeholder="First" required><label for="wpforms-13326-field_20" class="wpforms-field-sublabel after wpforms-sublabel-hide">First</label></div><div class="wpforms-field-row-block wpforms-one-half"><input type="text" id="wpforms-13326-field_20-last" class="wpforms-field-name-last wpforms-field-required" name="wpforms[fields][20][last]" placeholder="Last" required><label for="wpforms-13326-field_20-last" class="wpforms-field-sublabel after wpforms-sublabel-hide">Last</label></div></div></div><div id="wpforms-13326-field_21-container" class="wpforms-field wpforms-field-phone" data-field-type="phone" data-field-id="21"><label class="wpforms-field-label" for="wpforms-13326-field_21">Phone <span class="wpforms-required-label">*</span></label><input type="tel" id="wpforms-13326-